Start the system.
Initialize Arduino pins.
Read the temperature from the LM35 sensor.
Convert the sensor output into Celsius.
Compare the temperature with preset values.
If temperature is below 25°C, turn the fan OFF.
If temperature is between 25°C and 30°C, run the fan at low speed.
If temperature is between 30°C and 35°C, run the fan at medium speed.
If temperature is above 35°C, run the fan at full speed.
Repeat continuously.
